{%- comment -%}
  Figma: Components Molecules / Product form / Tags (Marquee, 2102:7221)
  tags    comma separated list, e.g. "Light natural scent, Safe for acne-prone skin, Vegan & cruelty-free"
  class   placement only
  One line of caps tags (label/caps-sm, muted), each behind a dot, scrolling sideways with faded edges.
  Runs on marquee-slider (stops for reduced motion). Renders nothing without tags.
  The strip is 20px tall with -4px margins: it still takes 12px in the layout, but the clip and the fade mask leave
  room above and below the trimmed text, so the letters are never cut (Safari 17, Hendrik 24 Nov).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign tag_list = tags | split: ',' -%}
{%- if tag_list.size > 0 -%}
  {%- assign per_copy = 12 | divided_by: tag_list.size | plus: 1 -%}
  <marquee-slider class="product-tags -my-1 flex h-5 w-full items-center overflow-hidden text-label-caps-sm text-text-muted [mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent_0%,black_10%,black_90%,transparent_100%)] {{ class }}" data-pixels-per-second="30">
    {%- for copy in (1..2) -%}
      <ul class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4 pr-4" role="list" data-marquee-wrapper{% if copy == 2 %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
        {%- for i in (1..per_copy) -%}
          {%- for tag in tag_list -%}
            {%- assign tag_text = tag | strip -%}
            {%- if tag_text != blank -%}
              <li class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap"{% if i > 1 %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
                <span class="size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>{{ tag_text | escape }}</span>
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </marquee-slider>
{%- endif -%}
